{
  "name": "Whip Rapier",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Rapier), Uncommon</em></p><p>The blade of this rapier is made of interlocking segments. You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p><strong>Segmented Blade.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you can unlock the blade into a flexible whip, or lock it back into a rapier. As a whip, the weapon deals 1d4 Slashing damage instead of 1d8 Piercing damage, has the Reach property, and uses the Slow mastery property instead of Vex; it keeps the Finesse property.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-WfxMbu3eOuqhy5UU\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Segmented Blade</em> donne à l’arme sa forme de fouet (1d4 Slashing, Reach, maîtrise Slow) ; utilisez-la de nouveau pour revenir à la rapière.</p></section>",
